<title>USA: Zapata to redeem 10-1/4 debt due March 1997.</title>
<headline>Zapata to redeem 10-1/4 debt due March 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zapata Corp said that on February 10 it will redeem the entire $15,621,200 principal amount of its 10-1/4 percent subordinated debentures due March 15, 1997.</p>
<p>It said IBJ Schroder Bank &amp; Trust Co is the trustee for the debentures.</p>
